strings.JAP_WAC_defend_gulf_of_guinea_desc:
Our most important priority currently in the West African War is to protect supply to the PALF and to deny it to the Free French.

While we don't wish to directly intervene in the conflict yet and risk an escalation, the Free French have a significant naval force which the Cameroonians cannot match. Despite our desires, we will need to provide direct naval support and resources to develop a fledgling Cameroonian Navy in order to protect our interests in the region.

The Gulf of Guinea Campaign is currently {getwacgulfadvantage}

strings.JAP_ICW_desc:
Once again, the Southern Resource Area is under threat. Sukarno and the Indonesians are facing a massive revolt of rebels and disloyal military cliques all across the archipelago. And the greedy imperialists in Australia and the OFN once more sense an opportunity to break into the sphere and take the mineral wealth of the islands for themselves. For the good of East Asia, we must not allow this to happen.

We will make sure Sukarno has the resources he needs to take care of this nonsense. Our support will be backed up with words and supplies. If need be, we will have to fight this conflict ourselves. East Asia needs Indonesia at all costs.

Current phase: {get_icwphase}

strings.JAP_the_dlc_investigation_desc:
What was once a simple intelligence operation turned out to be one of the largest conspiracies Japan would ever undergo as a nation, overwhelming even the central government, who's unable to determine the sheer scale of the conspiracy, let alone who's involved in it or what its aim is.
There are five possible leads one can take to solve the investigation, ranging from incursions deep into China, to covert operations in the United States, and lastly, investigations within Japan itself. Which path is chosen would determine your success in investigating the conspiracy: pick the correct path, and your conspiratorial investigation would go quicker than expected. Pick the wrong path, and you will be setting yourself down a dark path for not only Japan, but the whole Co-Prosperity Sphere.

