strings.JAP_yearly_balance_check_dynamic_desc:
Nothing can withstand the test of time, and as years pass by, any bonds and feelings will wither away.

If our current state is maintained, when this mission expires the following will occur:

Diet Faction Power:
Alliances in the Diet have a surprisingly short lifespan.
{getjappmpowerchange}
{getjappmpowerchangeexplanation}

Support of the House of Peers:
The House of Peers decides its own fate, or so they say. The House of Cards rebutes their claim.
{getjaphopsupportchange}
{getjaphopsupportchangeexplanation}

Public Approval:
Misinformation and broken promises are all too common in politics.
{getjappasupportchange}
{getjappasupportchangeexplanation}

The House of Cards continues to dance to time's cruel tune.
So enjoy your time in the spotlight while it lasts.

